# COURSE_ID lessonNN thought record

> A lazy carrier: created from the template only when a student's own formulation really appears; never
> pre-created as an empty file.
> The student's words and the teacher's response go in separate columns; they are never blended and the
> words are never rewritten.
> Only something with cross-course value is promoted to `main/10_student/profile/reasoning_patterns.md`;
> a study feeling that reaches the distillation gate is promoted to
> `main/10_student/profile/course_reflections.md`.
> The criteria are in `main/00_core/learning_activity_model.md`, rows 2 and 5.

## Entry format

```markdown
### TH-01｜one-sentence title
- Date: YYYY-MM-DD
- Trigger position: textbook page / block ID / which step of the explanation
- Category: own formulation / study feeling / metacognition
- Student's words:
  > recorded verbatim, not polished and not completed for them
- Teacher's response:
  the key points, in a separate column from the words; the response is never written into the words
- Follow-up: to be observed / promoted to reasoning_patterns / promoted to course_reflections / absorbed within this lesson
```

